  "title": "Plan Tool",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "b59a4ac997e33d00",
      "text": "Opened beside a plan, the state of that plan: its phases with their ticks, the next phase and what blocks it, its open questions and its lints. Opened beside anything else, every plan on this site, newest edit first, each a link that opens the plan beside this page. Beside any page it ends with a Trash Page button, which moves that page to the recycler, and a link to the [[Recycled Pages]]. Beside a research site's plan it offers Revise Site too: a Revision Proposal for the whole wiki from the answered questions, with Pause to keep it and Go Ahead to rewrite the pages it names, one at a time, the plan last."
    },
    {
      "type": "plan",
      "id": "8da40e8a41ccb137",
      "text": "SUBJECT"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "9101f3208b7b4818",
      "text": "- **\u27f3 Update Plan** ticks what the answers settled and re-renders the markdown; no model.\n- **\u2713 Finish Plan** appears when every checkpoint is ticked: the Conclusion and the demo link; no model.\n- **\u25b6 Do Next Phase** puts the plan's Do Phase button after the next phase, for a watched Claude Code session \u2014 a fresh session for each phase, which reads the plan and the previous phase's report; put `CONTEXT carry` under `STATUS` on the plan's status item to keep one conversation across phases.\n- **\u270e Revise Plan** opens the [[Revise Plan]] page beside the plan: choose from the answers, from your direction (typed, or spoken through the Voice Tool), catch up with the work, or tidy only. The redraft is a ghost with the plan's own title; fork it to save it over the plan.\n- **\u29c9 Revise Site** asks the model for a revision of the whole site from the answered questions.\n- **\u2315 Red-link** finds the links on the plan with no page behind them, researches each on the web and writes its page. Question links are left for their answers. Always Claude: only Claude has web search here.\n- **\u2699 model** names the model \u270e and \u29c9 ask, and opens [[Model Settings]] to change it; the farm's default is the LLM coop.\n- **Save over the plan** overwrites it with a rewindable journal: the version replaced is its _rev, and **Rewind** opens it beside the plan as a ghost: fork it to rewind, or close it."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "28c27827c7a26b03",
      "text": "More [[About Plan Plugin]]"
    }
  ],
